],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids February to March and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 44 of those years. In 2025 on the middle, February to March came in at 8% and November to December at 27%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 16% on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, and grid 16012 got 30% of normal that year.</p>"}
